# Wave W17-AA (Route 221): tide pine — a coast pine in blue-greens, tiered and marsh-cool, its highlight lifted clear of the turf, on tide turf (ground baked in). Route 221’s own tree — split from Route 222’s solar pine by colour entire (blue-green marsh air vs yellow-green city light) and from Route 212-South’s bog pine by stance: this pine stands on a walked coast, that one in standing bog water’s edge grass.
